#: desktopview.cpp:303
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to permanently hide the preview banner?<nl/><nl/>This "
"action can only be undone by removing the line beginning with "
"<icode>ShowDesktopPreviewBanner</icode> in the <filename>kdeglobals</"
"filename> config file."
msgstr ""
"Haqiqatan ham oldindan köriş bannerini butunlay yaşirmoqçimisiz?<nl/><nl/> "
"Bu amalni faqat <filename>kdeglobals</filename> "
"sozlaş faylidagi <icode>ShowDesktopPreviewBanner</icode> "
"bilan boşlanadigan qatorni olib taşlaş orqali bekor qiliş mumkin."

